{"title": "A Tenday's Prayers to Gond", "pageid": 30791, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/A_Tenday's_Prayers_to_Gond", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Note_F_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Book_Note_F_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_F_Image.png.webp, /w/images/5/5f/Book_Note_F_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"A Tenday's Prayers to Gond image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Book_Note_F_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_F_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Book_Note_F_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>A Tenday's Prayers to Gond</b> contains prayers for <a href=\"/wiki/Gond\" title=\"Gond\">Gond</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A plain, unadorned note.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/38px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/50px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Notes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\">Notes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Gondians\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gondians\" title=\"Gondians\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png/25px-Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png/38px-Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png/50px-Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gondians\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png/25px-Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gondians\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gondians\">Gondians</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Bookshelf in the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-330&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-157</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Gond grant me ACCURACY that I may record the details of my work well and truly\n</p><p><br>\nGond grant me ALTERATION that I may correctly imbue mechanisms with the magic of dynamic change\n</p><p><br>   \nGond grant me DEDUCTION that I may understand how my work is flawed and how to rectify it\n</p><p><br>   \nGond grant me INNOVATION that I may perceive new and better paths to fabrication\n</p><p><br>\nGond grant me INSPIRATION that I may grasp the whole and not just the parts\n</p><p><br>   \nGond grant me INTEGRITY that I may give my coworkers their due\n</p><p><br>   \nGond grant me OBJECTIVITY that I may see past wants and desires to what is\n</p><p><br>   \nGond grant me PRECISION that I may be meticulous and avoid error\n</p><p><br>   \nGond grant me PUNCTUALITY that I may coordinate efficiently with others\n</p><p><br>   \nGond grant me SOBRRIETY that I may perform my functions at full capacity\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204539\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1328/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19182/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7053/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 818206/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.962      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   32.962      1 -total\n 41.05%   13.531      6 Template:Icon_text\n 33.04%   10.892     13 Template:Trim\n 20.34%    6.706      1 Template:Main_only\n 17.81%    5.872      2 Template:Icon_link\n 15.75%    5.193      1 Template:Ifexist\n 13.45%    4.434      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.28%    4.379      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.01%    4.287      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30791-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714204539 and revision id 394583. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}